# Project architecture

## Stack

RN CLI 0.88+, New Architecture (Fabric + TurboModules), TypeScript strict, Hermes, Unistyles v3, React Navigation 7, Redux Toolkit (primary), Zustand (auth/UI), MMKV, Axios, RHF + Yup, i18next, Notifee.

## Where code goes

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Feature work | `src/features/<name>/` → `api/`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `screens/`, `store/`, `types/`, `validation/`, `index.ts` |
| Shared UI | `src/components/atoms|molecules|organisms/` |
| HTTP core | `src/api/` (`client`, `errors`) |
| Types (global DTOs) | `src/types/` or feature `types/` |
| Navigation types | `src/navigation/types.ts` — extend param lists before new routes |
| State | `src/store/redux/` (server/cache), `src/store/zustand/` (auth, theme mode) |
| Theme / breakpoints | `src/theme/` (`unistyles.ts`: `fold` 600, `md` 768, `lg` 992) |
| Config (no secrets in git) | `keys.*.json` + `Config` from `@config/env` |
| Native contracts | `specs/Native*.ts` → TurboModule / Fabric |
| Tests | `__tests__/` mirrors `src/` |
| Docs | `docs/DOCUMENTATION.md`, `docs/SPEC_DRIVEN_DEVELOPMENT.md` |

Imports: path aliases only (`@components`, `@features`, `@api`, `@hooks`, `@test-utils`, …). No `../../../`.

## Decision table

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| API calls | `apiClient` + typed modules; catch → `normalizeApiError`; silent requests: Axios `silent: true` |
| Cancel on unmount | RTK `promise.abort()` or `useApiCancellation().signal` |
| User-visible errors | `Toast` (`@components/organisms`); global network toast in interceptor unless `silent` |
| Loader | `AppConstant.showLoader` / `hideLoader` (reference counted) |
| Strings | `useTranslation()` — keys in `en.json`, `es.json`, `ar.json` |
| Persistence | `storage` from `@services/storage` (MMKV) |

## Workflow

- Branch: `feat/`, `fix/`, `chore/` from `main`.
- Before push: `yarn ci` (typecheck, lint, format, test, knip).
- Commits: Conventional Commits (commitlint).
- Behavior change → add/update `__tests__/`; render via `@test-utils`.

## Spec-driven (optional)

Jira AC → tests; Postman → `src/types` + `src/api`; Figma → `theme.*` tokens. MCP agent flow: `docs/SPEC_DRIVEN_DEVELOPMENT.md` §3.1.

## UI rules (this repo)

- Screens: `flex: 1` + `theme.colors.background`; top safe area only in `Header` (`insets.top`).
- Bottom overlays (sheet, toast): account for Android nav bar — see `docs/DOCUMENTATION.md` inset formula.
- Styles: Unistyles breakpoint maps for width/fold; `useBreakpoint()` when layout structure changes.
- No hex/magic spacing; no inline styles in list `renderItem`.

## Agent discipline

Production-ready diffs only (no TODO stubs). Smallest change that satisfies the task. No new dependencies without clear need. No credentials in repo.

## Performance deep-dive

When profiling FPS, lists, or TTI: apply `.cursor/rules/callstack-performance.mdc`.